 N: adding a 5th server reshuffles ~80% of ALL keys", "originalText": "Naive hash % N: adding a 5th server reshuffles ~80% of ALL keys", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 38, "width": 507.78, "height": 16.900000000000002}, {"id": "evidence_before_1", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 696, "text": "(every key's owner depends on N, which just changed).", "originalText": "(every key's owner depends on N, which just changed).", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 39, "width": 427.18, "height": 16.900000000000002}, {"id": "evidence_after_0", "type": "text", "x": 620, "y": 680, "text": "Consistent hashing: E only steals the slice (4000, 6000] from C.", "originalText": "Consistent hashing: E only steals the slice (4000, 6000] from C.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 40, "width": 515.84, "height": 16.900000000000002}, {"id": "evidence_after_1", "type": "text", "x": 620, "y": 696, "text": "A, B, D keep every key they owned before -- untouched.", "originalText": "A, B, D keep every key they owned before -- untouched.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 41, "width": 435.24, "height": 16.900000000000002}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}}